Z||000000||maryjane||07-07-2001||11:43 AM||||Earthlink is my email,internet provider and browser all rolled into one. Jane works nights and sleeps days, so I usually have the sound turned off to not disturb her on weekends. Earthlink mail uses a .wav to notify me of mail but no popup or anything visual. Anyway to easily associate some graphic to the new mail sound? ( I don't like to wear earphones and would like to keep my current email setup} Thanks<P>BTW earthlink's rates are going to increase to $22/month if you didn't already know.<P>------------------<BR>84 SE 2.5<BR>not slow not fast-just halfast||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||07-07-2001||12:27 PM||||Web mail can't use tray icons. Stop using web mail and use outlook eudora or some other real mail program. Then you can control all that.<P>If you use outlook, you need to make a couple small security changes to be more safe. The change prevents mail from running embedded scripts and setting cookies.<P>Rate is going up but you get more web space and more mailboxes.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 07-07-2001).]||||reg||1
